    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Not available yet",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 12, "w": 12, "h": 4 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Queue time (p50/p95 by repo) and job duration are not on this dashboard.** The `workflow_run`/`workflow_job` collectors that would produce them read only from github_exporter's own database, which only its built-in webhook receiver populates — and this estate has no path for GitHub to deliver a webhook to an internal-only host. Tracked as an open gap in roles/github_exporter/README.md, not fixed by widening a permission."
      }
    }
